- Why is that?

00:00:11.843 --> 00:00:13.260
What's the methodology?

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:17.640
- It's offense, I think
people say no too often.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.630
because they fear ramifications.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:23.070
I don't think micro losses are scary

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:27.820
