00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:42.360
Like, eventually you have
to let your kid swim,

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.360
eventually you have to
let them swing the bat.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:50.360
And so yeah, I'm completely
not driven by fear

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.040
and people are and the reason

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.080
people don't let people
do things is they fear it,

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.080
or they have, I mean, it's ego.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:59.570
