00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:05.430
It's just insecurity.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:08.040
I'm massively secure in myself

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:11.160
and that's exactly right,
Caleb, that's a good insight,

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.780
